# Database Patterns

## Overview
Database query optimization, transaction management, migration patterns, and repository organization.

## Query Optimization

### Indexes
**✅ CORRECT - Use indexes for frequently queried fields:**
```typescript
@Index(['email'])
@Index(['createdAt'])
export class User {
  @Column()
  email: string;
  
  @Column()
  createdAt: Date;
}
```

### Avoid N+1 Queries
**✅ CORRECT - Use joins:**
```typescript
const users = await this.repository.find({
  relations: ['orders', 'profile'],
});
```

## Transaction Management

**✅ CORRECT - Use transactions:**
```typescript
await this.dataSource.transaction(async (manager) => {
  await manager.save(user);
  await manager.save(order);
});
```

## Error Handling

**✅ CORRECT - Use handleDatabaseError:**
```typescript
import { handleDatabaseError } from '@microservices-shared/common/exceptions';

try {
  const result = await this.repository.find();
  timer.stop(PredefinedTags.SUCCESS);
  return result;
} catch (error) {
  handleDatabaseError(error, timer, this.logger, 'Query failed', 'Database error');
}
```

